    "facet_anxiety": "High on the Anxiety facet (Neuroticism), you fret over possibilities, tense up in ambiguity, and replay worries, like fretting about job interviews or relationships far in advance.",
    "facet_cheerfulness": "Low Cheerfulness (Extraversion facet) means your positive emotions are muted; you seldom burst with joy or enthusiasm, offering restrained smiles rather than exuberant laughter even in pleasant moments."
